      en: "Crève Coeur is a picturesque mountain village at the foot of Pieter Both mountain. It is famous for its intensive ginger and pineapple farming.",
      es: "Crève Coeur es un pintoresco pueblo de montaña al pie de la montaña Pieter Both. Es famoso por su cultivo intensivo de jengibre y piña.",
